2) sudo apt install unzip curl -y
3) Download AWS CLI: curl "https://awscli.amazonaws.com/awscli-exe-linux-x86_64.zip" -o "awscliv2.zip"
4) Unzip: unzip awscliv2.zip
5) Install: sudo ./aws/install
6) Check installation: aws --version
